{"seq":1,"slug":"prefix-matching","title":"前缀匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics/prefix-matching","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"前缀匹配\">前缀匹配</h1><p>把缓存引擎想象成一个固执的门卫：它拿你这次请求的提示，和它记得的旧提示，从第一个 token 开始一个一个对，对到第一个不一样的地方就停手，宣布「从这里往后我都不认识，全得重算」。它不会跳过差异往后找相同片段，也不在乎你后面写得多么眼熟。理解这个固执到近乎愚钝的比对规则，是预测任何一次请求命中多少、从哪开始重新计费的唯一方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前缀匹配（prefix matching）的规则只有一句：<strong>命中长度 = 本次前缀与已缓存前缀的最长公共前缀。</strong> 这里「前缀」严格指从序列开头算起、连续相同的那一段。一旦在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个内容块（或 token）处出现差异，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个及之后全部判为未命中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[新请求前缀] --&gt; B[与缓存前缀&lt;br/&gt;从位置 0 起逐块比对]&#10;    B --&gt; C{当前块相同?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[命中, 指针前移]&#10;    D --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[在此分叉&lt;br/&gt;停止比对]&#10;    E --&gt; F[分叉点之前: 全部命中&lt;br/&gt;读取已缓存 KV]&#10;    E --&gt; G[分叉点及之后: 全部未命中&lt;br/&gt;重新 prefill 并写入]\">flowchart TD\n    A[新请求前缀] --&gt; B[与缓存前缀&lt;br/&gt;从位置 0 起逐块比对]\n    B --&gt; C{当前块相同?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[命中, 指针前移]\n    D --&gt; C\n    C --&gt;|否| E[在此分叉&lt;br/&gt;停止比对]\n    E --&gt; F[分叉点之前: 全部命中&lt;br/&gt;读取已缓存 KV]\n    E --&gt; G[分叉点及之后: 全部未命中&lt;br/&gt;重新 prefill 并写入]</pre><p>设缓存前缀为序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = (c_1, c_2, \\dots, c_m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，新请求前缀为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P = (p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则命中长度</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> 对所有 </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\max\\{ k : c_i = p_i \\text{ 对所有 } i \\le k \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">对所有</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>请求里前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 走缓存读取价，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个走标准价并被写入缓存。这条公式是整个机制章和优化章的轴心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么是-前缀-而不是-子串\">为什么是「前缀」而不是「子串」</h2><p>这是最容易误解的点。开发者常以为「我前后两次请求里都有那段 3000 token 的工具定义，应该能复用」——但如果工具定义前面有一个每次都变的时间戳，那么从时间戳那个 token 起就分叉了，后面的工具定义即便逐字相同也无法命中。</p>\n<p>根源在 <a href=\"../foundations/prompt-vs-kv-cache\">KV 缓存的因果性</a>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的 K、V 依赖前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的全部内容。工具定义那段文字虽然一样，但它前面的 token 变了，导致它的注意力上下文变了，算出的 K、V 也就不同了——缓存里存的是旧上下文下的 KV，对新请求不正确。所以缓存只能复用「上下文完全一致」的那段，也就是从头连续相同的前缀。</p>\n<p>下表对比两个看起来都「有相同内容」的请求，命中结果天差地别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>旧前缀</th>\n<th>新前缀</th>\n<th>命中长度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态在前</td>\n<td><code>[系统提示][工具]</code></td>\n<td><code>[系统提示][工具][新问]</code></td>\n<td>系统提示+工具全部命中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态在前</td>\n<td><code>[10:00 时间戳][系统提示]</code></td>\n<td><code>[10:05 时间戳][系统提示]</code></td>\n<td>几乎 0（时间戳处即分叉）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中段改动</td>\n<td><code>[系统提示][工具 v1][历史]</code></td>\n<td><code>[系统提示][工具 v2][历史]</code></td>\n<td>只命中到系统提示末尾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二、三行就是绝大多数「缓存没生效」事故的模型，根治方法是优化章的 <a href=\"../optimization/prompt-structuring\">面向缓存的提示结构</a>：把所有会变的东西挪到最后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配的粒度-token-还是内容块\">匹配的粒度：token 还是内容块</h2><p>不同厂商在不同层级做比对，影响你该如何组织提示。Anthropic 的提示缓存以 <strong>content block</strong>（消息里的一个内容块，如一段文本、一个工具定义、一张图）为基本单位标记和匹配，并要求被缓存的前缀达到模型的最小 token 数（不同模型阈值不同）才生效。底层比对仍是 token 级，但你能下手的控制点是块级的 <code>cache_control</code> 标记。</p>\n<p>这带来一个实务约束：Anthropic 文档指出，如果某个缓存断点之前有超过 20 个内容块，而你改动了更靠前的块，可能拿不到命中——应对办法是每隔约 18 个块插一个中间断点（<a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching\">来源</a>）。OpenAI 则是纯自动、按 token 前缀匹配，无需你标记块，但要求前缀至少 1024 token 才进入缓存。粒度差异决定了你在不同厂商手里要写不同的提示组织代码，详见 <a href=\"../practice/provider-caching\">各厂商提示缓存</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多前缀分叉-一棵共享前缀树\">多前缀分叉：一棵共享前缀树</h2><p>当多个请求共享同一段开头、在不同位置分叉时，缓存形成一棵<strong>前缀树</strong>（trie）：公共的根部分只存一份、被所有分支复用，各分支只为自己独有的尾部付费。这正是 prefix sharing 在服务端的样子（与 <a href=\"../kv-cache-optimization/memory/prefix-sharing\">KV 缓存的前缀共享</a> 是同一机制）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[共享根: 系统提示+工具] --&gt; B[分支1: 用户A 历史]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分支2: 用户B 历史]&#10;    A --&gt; D[分支3: 批任务 文档X]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[A 的新问]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[B 的新问]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[文档X 的问题]\">graph TD\n    A[共享根: 系统提示+工具] --&gt; B[分支1: 用户A 历史]\n    A --&gt; C[分支2: 用户B 历史]\n    A --&gt; D[分支3: 批任务 文档X]\n    B --&gt; B1[A 的新问]\n    C --&gt; C1[B 的新问]\n    D --&gt; D1[文档X 的问题]</pre><p>根节点那段大前缀只 prefill 一次、写入一次，三个分支全部读取复用——这就是为什么把最稳定、最大段的内容放在最前面收益最高：它能被最多的后续请求当作公共根。批量同前缀任务、多用户共享同一份长文档，都是在刻意制造一个又大又稳的共享根。这也是 <a href=\"../optimization/cross-session-cache\">跨会话缓存</a> 的工作原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>前缀匹配规则一句话：命中长度 = 本次前缀与缓存前缀的最长公共前缀，分叉点之后全部重算。</li>\n<li>是「前缀」不是「子串」：内容相同但其前面的 token 变了，仍不命中——根在 KV 因果性。</li>\n<li>公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = \\max\\{k : c_i = p_i, \\forall i \\le k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 决定哪些 token 走读取价、哪些走标准价并写入。</li>\n<li>匹配粒度因厂商而异：Anthropic 块级标记 + 最小 token 阈值，OpenAI token 级自动 + 1024 起步。</li>\n<li>多请求共享前缀形成前缀树，公共根只算一次被所有分支复用——把大而稳的内容放最前面收益最大。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>失效规则的数学根源：<a href=\"../foundations/prompt-vs-kv-cache\">提示缓存与 KV 缓存</a></li>\n<li>把控制点用好：<a href=\"cache-breakpoints\">缓存断点设计</a></li>\n<li>让前缀稳定的排版铁律：<a href=\"../optimization/prompt-structuring\">面向缓存的提示结构</a></li>\n<li>服务端的前缀共享底层：<a href=\"../kv-cache-optimization/memory/prefix-sharing\">前缀共享</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前缀匹配","id":"前缀匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么是「前缀」而不是「子串」","id":"为什么是-前缀-而不是-子串"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配的粒度：token 还是内容块","id":"匹配的粒度-token-还是内容块"},{"level":2,"text":"多前缀分叉：一棵共享前缀树","id":"多前缀分叉-一棵共享前缀树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存语义与失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/foundations/cache-semantics"},"next":{"title":"缓存断点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-caching-systems/mechanics/cache-breakpoints"}}